{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TVB新劇《模範律師團》早前順利完成深圳外景，劇組近日已火速返港繼續拍攝。昨日（4日）有網民在赤柱「野生捕獲」正在開工的視后楊茜堯，只見她以一身俐落短髮搭配黑色恤衫上陣，氣場全開，霸氣的型格Look隨即在網上掀起熱烈討論！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"17184ea3-7062-4c5a-af10-1b6751df42f9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026pRTdECj6g91785912860.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"17184ea3-7062-4c5a-af10-1b6751df42f9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在網民分享的無濾鏡「路人視角」照片中可見，楊茜堯全情投入角色，皮膚狀態與精神面貌依然極佳，舉手投足間都散發着強烈的自信與霸氣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據現場粉絲透露，她對待工作極度認真，在開拍前一刻依然手執劇本專心研讀對白，而當導演一喊開機，她便瞬間入戲，切換成氣場強大的律師，專業態度令人佩服。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3cf4c09d-d83a-4c4f-af84-a6bcfe6e99de.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ydle9OzLoy1785912860.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3cf4c09d-d83a-4c4f-af84-a6bcfe6e99de.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2212cc99-3310-4973-938a-b984b5ef670c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20268Dm59z1Is11785912860.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2212cc99-3310-4973-938a-b984b5ef670c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"18209e17-7eb7-4f4c-a79a-9f479552faa3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026CTxYSmQZ9n1785912860.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"18209e17-7eb7-4f4c-a79a-9f479552faa3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">拍攝花絮照曝光後，大批網民紛紛大讚楊茜堯不愧是「視后級」人馬：「隨便影一張相，都覺得佢個眼神背後有故事」、「生圖都咁靚，保養得太好啦！」、「黑恤衫加短髮真係好啱佢」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T09:40:15.795366+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}